# ─── SECRETS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is meant to be public. Nothing in this block may ever be committed.
# The light build is designed to need NONE of these — if one of these files
# appears, something has been added that puts a stranger's network at risk.
**/wifi_creds.h
**/ha_creds.h
**/*_creds.h
!**/*_creds.example.h
**/secrets.h
**/secrets.yaml
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
# Git credential store, if a token is cached per-repo (see docs/CONTRIBUTING.md)
.git-credentials

# ─── ESP-IDF BUILD OUTPUT ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
firmware/build/
firmware/sdkconfig
firmware/sdkconfig.old
firmware/managed_components/
firmware/dependencies.lock
# sdkconfig.defaults IS tracked. The generated sdkconfig is NOT: a stale one
# silently wins over the defaults and costs hours. Learned the hard way.

# ─── CAD ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FreeCAD backups only. The .FCStd source and the exported STLs ARE tracked.
*.FCBak
*.FCStd1

# ─── EDITORS / OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
